      "value": "I think everyone is having different issues, but if possible can you ensure that steamvr is in focus while you play vrchat. I think if steamvr is not in focus vrchat has some weird input issues. This is unconfirmed but something worth trying if you are still having issues and letting me know if you notice any changes in behaviour.",
