      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I have the same issue on right hand when uaing default bindings, but not older custom ones. However I dont have any issues on the left hand. The gesture thing might be fixed if we can separate analog stick and touchpad, use the stick exclusively for movement, and touchpad for gestures and other actions. Btw, you can add the jump and mute toggle to the old bindings too. Add the trackpad as dpad option, mix toggle is righr a button and jump is left A button (or other way arouns, don't remember)!\nAlso want to add that my friend who also uses WMR has the same issue with right hand touchpad moving camera instead of gestures.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
