  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-09-03T20:33:19.241Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I have set my bindings to the default WMR bindings for VRChat so I can take advantage of the Mute Toggle, however I have noticed that whenever I move backwards using the Joystick, I move forward just a tad.\nIf I slowly pull my Joystick down, I move forward.\nSeems like there is some overlap between Moving Back and Forth.\nI've fiddled with the deadzone and all that and have managed to reduce the intensity, but not completely remove it.\nAlso I have noticed that my Gestures on my right hand get stuck, it seems to happen if I use the joystick to turn my camera, cause if I go back to the touchpad to enable a gesture, not only does nothing happen, the Touchpad turns the camera even though I disabled that binding on the touchpad.",
